---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Web Tracking, Google Tag Manager & Analytics | Valorferrum"
  description="Tracking-Setup mit Google Analytics 4, Tag Manager & Server-Side-Tracking. Datenschutzkonforme Lösungen für datengesteuerte Entscheidungen."
  lang="de"
>
  <!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->
  <section class="relative pt-32 pb-20 px-6 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-spectrum-yellow/8 rounded-full blur-[120px] pulse-anim"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 left-1/4 w-80 h-80 bg-spectrum-blue/6 rounded-full blur-[100px] float-anim"></div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative">
      <div class="reveal mb-4">
        <a href="/de/leistungen/" class="text-sm text-text-muted hover:text-primary transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1 group">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:-translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Alle Leistungen
        </a>
      </div>

      <h1 class="reveal font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-6 leading-tight" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        Tracking & Analytics
      </h1>
      <p class="reveal text-text-secondary text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
  Daten, die Entscheidungen treffen. Nicht nur Zahlen sammeln, sondern verstehen – 
  mit sauberem Tracking, das Dein Marketing messbar macht. 
  Ob Google Analytics 4, Matomo, Etracker oder Server-Side-Lösungen.
</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== DIE 4 SÄULEN ==================== -->
  <section class="pb-24 px-6" aria-labelledby="saeulen-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 id="saeulen-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Google Analytics 4, Tag Manager & Server-Side Tracking
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          Ich baue die Infrastruktur, die Dein Marketing trägt. Von der ersten Datenerfassung 
          bis zum verständlichen Report.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- GA4 -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-primary/30 transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Google Analytics 4</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Richtig konfiguriert, nicht nur installiert. Ich baue ein GA4-Setup, 
            das Deine Geschäftsziele abbildet – nicht nur generische Events zählt.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Property-Setup, Data Streams & Conversions</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>Custom Dimensions, Events & Audiences</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-primary mt-0.5">→</span>E-Commerce Tracking & Enhanced Measurement</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- GTM -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-blue/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Google Tag Manager</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Der Dreh- und Angelpunkt Deines Trackings. Ich implementiere Tags, Trigger und Variablen 
            sauber – dokumentiert, wartbar und fehlerfrei.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Container-Setup, Tags & Trigger-Logik</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Data Layer Implementierung & Debugging</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-blue mt-0.5">→</span>Custom HTML, Templates & Variablen</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Server-Side -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-pink/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 12h14M5 12a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v4a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 12a2 2 0 01-2 2v4a2 2 0 012 2h14a2 2 0 012-2v-4a2 2 0 01-2-2m-2-4h.01M17 16h.01"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Server-Side Tracking</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Zukunftssicher und datenschutzkonform. Server-Side Tracking gibt Dir Kontrolle über Deine Daten 
            zurück – unabhängig von Browser-Beschränkungen und Adblockern.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>GTM Server-Side & Stape.io Setup</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>Meta CAPI, Google Ads Conversion API</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-pink mt-0.5">→</span>First-Party Data & Cookie-Lifetime-Extension</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Reporting -->
        <div class="reveal card p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface border border-border hover:border-spectrum-yellow/30 transition-all duration-500" style="transition-delay: 300ms;">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-spectrum-yellow/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-spectrum-yellow" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 3.055A9.001 9.001 0 1020.945 13H11V3.055z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20.488 9H15V3.512A9.025 9.025 0 0120.488 9z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3">Reporting & Dashboards</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Daten, die man versteht – nicht nur schöne Charts. Ich baue Dashboards, 
            die Entscheidungen erleichtern und nicht verwirren.
          </p>
          <ul class="text-text-secondary text-sm space-y-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Looker Studio & BigQuery Integration</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Automatisierte Reports & Alerts</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-spectrum-yellow mt-0.5">→</span>Custom KPI-Dashboards für Stakeholder</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== KONKRETE TRACKING-MASSNAHMEN ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface relative overflow-hidden" aria-labelledby="massnahmen-heading">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[800px] h-[400px] bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/5 to-transparent rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 id="massnahmen-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Konkrete Tracking-Lösungen für Dein Business
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          Jedes Unternehmen hat andere Datenbedürfnisse. Ich implementiere Tracking, 
          das zu Deinen Zielen passt – nicht generische Standard-Setups.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <!-- Conversion Tracking -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">Conversion Tracking</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            Jede wichtige Aktion wird gemessen: Käufe, Anfragen, Downloads, Registrierungen. 
            Ich definiere Conversions, die Dein Geschäft voranbringen.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- E-Commerce Tracking -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 11V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4M5 9h14l1 12H4L5 9z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">E-Commerce Tracking</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            Produktansichten, Warenkörbe, Käufe, Refunds. Vom Enhanced Ecommerce in GA4 
            bis zum serverseitigen Purchase-Event – vollständige Shop-Analyse.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Data Layer -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-pink/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-pink" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">Data Layer Implementierung</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            Die Datenstruktur hinter dem Tracking. Ich baue saubere Data Layers, 
            die Entwickler verstehen und die Marketing-Tools zuverlässig auslesen können.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- DSGVO -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 50ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-yellow/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-yellow" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">DSGVO-konformes Tracking</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            Consent-Management, Cookie-Banner-Integration, Datenlöschung und Anonymisierung. 
            Tracking, das rechtlich auf der sicheren Seite ist.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Cross-Domain -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 150ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">Cross-Domain Tracking</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            Nutzer reisen über mehrere Domains? Ich stelle sicher, dass die Customer Journey 
            lückenlos erfasst wird – ohne doppelte Sessions oder verlorene Attribution.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Custom Events -->
        <div class="reveal p-8 rounded-2xl bg-bg/50 border border-border/50" style="transition-delay: 250ms;">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-spectrum-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-spectrum-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 15l-2 5L9 9l11 4-5 2zm0 0l5 5M7.188 2.239l.777 2.897M5.136 7.965l-2.898-.777M13.95 4.05l-2.122 2.122m-5.657 5.656l-2.12 2.122"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-3 text-center">Event-Tracking & Custom Events</h3>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed text-center">
            Scroll-Tiefe, Video-Engagement, Formular-Abbrüche, Button-Klicks. 
            Ich messe das Verhalten, das für Dein Business relevant ist – nicht nur Standard-Events.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== TRACKING KPIs ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-bg" aria-labelledby="kpis-heading">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
  <h2 id="kpis-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
    Web Analytics & Tracking KPIs
  </h2>
  <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
    Tracking ist nur so gut wie die Daten, die es liefert. Ich Werte eure Seite auf Basis hochwertiger Web Analytics Standards aus.
  </p>
</div>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border">
          <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Conversion Rate</div>
          <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Aktionsrate</div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Wie viele Besucher führen die gewünschte Aktion aus? Der zentrale Indikator für Tracking-Erfolg und UX-Qualität.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay: 50ms;">
          <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Tracking Coverage</div>
          <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Erfassungsrate</div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Wie viel Prozent des Traffics wird tatsächlich erfasst? Adblocker, Consent-Ablehnung und Fehler reduzieren die Coverage.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Consent Rate -->
<div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay: 150ms;">
  <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Consent Rate</div>
  <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Zustimmungsrate</div>
  <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">
    Wie viele Nutzer geben ihr Tracking-Consent? Ein entscheidender Wert für DSGVO-Konformität 
    und die Menge erfassbarer Daten.
  </p>
</div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay: 150ms;">
          <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Engagement Rate</div>
          <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Nutzertiefe</div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Sitzungsdauer, Seiten pro Besuch, Interaktionsrate. Zeigt, ob Deine Inhalte die Nutzer wirklich ansprechen.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Attribution</div>
          <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Kanalzuordnung</div>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Welcher Kanal bringt welche Conversions? Ich konfiguriere Data-Driven Attribution, die den tatsächlichen Customer Journey folgt.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Tracked Events -->
<div class="reveal p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface border border-border" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
  <div class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-2xl mb-2">Tracked Events</div>
  <div class="text-text-primary font-semibold mb-1">Erfasste Interaktionen</div>
  <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">
    Wie viele relevante Nutzeraktionen werden pro Sitzung gemessen? Zeigt, ob das Tracking 
    die wichtigen Touchpoints abdeckt.
  </p>
</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== PROZESS ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 bg-surface" aria-labelledby="prozess-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 id="prozess-heading" class="reveal font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">
          Tracking Prozess: Von der Analyse zum live Setup
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-text-secondary max-w-2xl" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          Tracking ist kein Fire-and-Forget. Ich arbeite strukturiert – von der Bestandsaufnahme 
          bis zur laufenden Qualitätssicherung.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="reveal flex gap-6 p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50 hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors">
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-primary/40 shrink-0 w-12">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Tracking Audit & Bestandsaufnahme</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Was ist bereits vorhanden? Was funktioniert, was ist fehlerhaft, was fehlt komplett? 
              Ich analysiere Dein aktuelles Setup auf Lücken, Doppelungen und Datenschutz-Risiken.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal flex gap-6 p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50 hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-primary/40 shrink-0 w-12">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Konzept & Implementierung</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Messplan, Data Layer, Tag-Struktur und Consent-Logik. Ich dokumentiere alles vorab 
              und setze es sauber um – wartbar und skalierbar.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal flex gap-6 p-6 rounded-xl bg-bg border border-border/50 hover:border-primary/20 transition-colors" style="transition-delay: 200ms;">
          <div class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-primary/40 shrink-0 w-12">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary mb-2">Testing, QA & Monitoring</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Jeder Tag wird getestet, bevor er live geht. Ich validiere Daten in DebugView, 
              prüfe Consent-Abfolgen und richte Monitoring ein – damit Fehler nicht unbemerkt bleiben.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== CTA ==================== -->
  <section class="py-24 px-6 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-spectrum-yellow/15 via-spectrum-pink/10 to-spectrum-blue/15"></div>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center relative">
      <p class="reveal text-lg text-text-secondary mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        Ob GA4-Migration, Server-Side-Setup oder komplette Tracking-Strategie: 
        Lass uns in einem kostenlosen Erstgespräch herausfinden, wo Deine Datenlücken sind.
      </p>
      <div class="reveal flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center" style="transition-delay: 100ms;">
        <a href="/de/kontakt/" class="px-8 py-4 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg shadow-primary/25 hover:shadow-primary/40 hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0">
          Kostenloses Erstgespräch
        </a>
        <a href="/de/preise/" class="px-8 py-4 border border-primary/30 hover:border-primary text-primary hover:text-primary-light rounded-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-primary/5">
          Preise & Pakete
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>